              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nikawaudhi watu wa Njia hii hata kuwaua, nikawafunga, nikiwatia gerezani, wanaume na wanawake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama Kuhani Mkuu naye anishuhudiavyo, na wazee wa baraza wote pia, ambao nilipokea barua kutoka kwao kuwapelekea ndugu wale, nikaenda Dameski, ili niwalete wale waliokuwa huko hadi Yerusalemu, wakiwa wamefungwa, ili waadhibiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo asema juu ya kuongoka kwake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa nilipokuwa nikisafiri, nikikaribia Dameski, wakati wa adhuhuri, ghafla nuru kuu ilitoka mbinguni, ikanimulikia pande zote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikaanguka chini, nikasikia sauti ikiniambia, Sauli, Sauli, mbona unaniudhi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikajibu, Wewe u nani, Bwana? Akaniambia, Mimi ni Yesu Mnazareti, ambaye wewe unaniudhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wale waliokuwa pamoja nami waliiona ile nuru, lakini hawakuisikia ile sauti ya yule aliyesema nami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikasema, Nifanye nini, Bwana? Bwana akaniambia, Simama, uingie Dameski, na huko utaambiwa habari za mambo yote yaliyoamriwa uyafanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na nilipokuwa sioni kwa sababu ya fahari ya nuru ile, nikaongozwa na mikono yao waliokuwa pamoja nami, nikaingia Dameski. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi mtu mmoja, Anania, mtauwa kwa kuifuata sheria, aliyeshuhudiwa wema na Wayahudi wote waliokaa huko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanijia, akasimama karibu nami, akaniambia, Ndugu yangu Sauli, pata kuona tena. Nikamwinulia macho yangu saa ile ile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.3.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mdo 3:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akasema, Mungu wa baba zetu amekuchagua wewe upate kujua mapenzi yake, na kumwona yule Mwenye haki, na kuisikia sauti itokayo katika kinywa chake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa maana utakuwa shahidi wake kwa watu wote, wa mambo hayo uliyoyaona na kuyasikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 2:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi sasa, mbona unakawia? Simama, ubatizwe, ukaoshwe dhambi zako, ukiliitia jina lake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo atumwa kwa Wamataifa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
